ightsail’s built-in Let’s Encrypt cert: run bncert-tool to generate/auto-renew SSL.\\n   1.6  Create an automated snapshot schedule for nightly backups (7-day retention).\\n\\n2. Initial WordPress Hardening\\n   2.1  Change default Bitnami admin password.\\n   2.2  Create a new administrator account (e.g., “hoa_admin”), then delete the default user.\\n   2.3  Install & configure security plugins: Wordfence Security (free), Disable XML-RPC, Limit Login Attempts.\\n\\n3. Core Plugins for Functionality\\n   3.1  Members (members-only access control) – free.\\n        • Create a custom role “Resident”.\\n   3.2  WPForms Lite – Contact Form (connect to SMTP).\\n   3.3  Classic Editor (optional) for simpler post/page editing UI.\\n\\n4. Theme & UI\\n   4.1  Install the Astra theme (lightweight, customizable, mobile-responsive).\\n   4.2  Import a starter template closest to the desired layout (e.g., “Charity”); remove unneeded pages.\\n   4.3  Customize colors, logo, and header/footer text placeholders (neighborhood name, address, phone).\\n\\n5. Page & Menu Structure\\n   5.1  Public Pages\\n        • Home (intro + latest public news snippets)\\n        • Contact Us (WPForms form)\\n        • Bylaws (static content or PDF embed)\\n        • Schools (links/info)\\n   5.2  Protected Pages (Resident role only)\\n        • Dues (PDFs or tables of dues schedules)\\n        • Annual Meetings (minutes, agendas)\\n        • News & Events (blog category restricted to Residents)\\n   5.3  Use Members plugin to restrict pages & the “News & Events” post category to logged-in Residents.\\n\\n6. Resident Management Workflow\\n   6.1  Registration model: \\\"Admin-creates-accounts\\\" for security (no open signup).\\n        • Provide CSV upload template for bulk resident creation.\\n        • Email residents a password-reset link upon creation.\\n   6.2  (Optional) Enable self-registration with admin approval if HOA prefers.\\n\\n7. Content Editing Simplicity\\n   7.1  Configure TinyMCE Advanced so editors have a WYSIWYG toolbar only (no HTML needed).\\n   7.2  Provide a 1-page quick-start guide (PDF) with screenshots for adding/editing posts and uploading PDFs.\\n\\n8. Contact Form Delivery\\n   8.1  Set SMTP plugin (WP Mail SMTP) to use Amazon SES or Gmail API for reliable mail.\\n   8.2  Test form delivery to board@hoa.org.\\n\\n9. Finishing & Handover\\n   9.1  Run WordPress Site Health checker – resolve critical items.\\n   9.2  Verify all protected pages return login prompt to anonymous users.\\n   9.3  Verify mobile responsiveness (Chrome DevTools & BrowserStack quick pass).\\n   9.4  Export Lightsail snapshot labeled “baseline-production”.\\n   9.5  Deliver admin credentials, backup instructions, and the quick-start PDF to the User.\\n\\n10. Ongoing Maintenance (documented for the user)\\n   • Monthly plugin/theme/core updates via Lightsail SSH auto-upgrade script or WP Toolkit.\\n   • Quarterly snapshot.\\n   • Annual password rotation.\\n\\nAgent Delegation Outline\\n   • Director of Infrastructure – own Steps 1-2 (CLI automation on AWS).\\n   • Director of WordPress Build – own Steps 3-5 and 6.\\n   • Director of UX & Training – own Steps 4.3, 7, 9.5, and documentation.\\n\\n---END DEP---\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}","genkit:output":"{\"candidates\":[{\"index\":0,\"finishReason\":\"stop\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"APPROVE\"}]},\"custom\":{}}],\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":1553,\"outputTokens\":405,\"totalTokens\":1958},\"custom\":{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-BxeWjEap5WKkvgzUW85ayNCPHKtvC\",\"object\":\"chat.completion\",\"created\":1753556837,\"model\":\"o3-2025-04-16\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"APPROVE\",\"refusal\":null,\"annotations\":[]},\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}],\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":1553,\"completion_tokens\":405,\"total_tokens\":1958,\"prompt_tokens_details\":{\"cached_tokens\":0,\"audio_tokens\":0},\"completion_tokens_details\":{\